    "Which copy to keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Kopie behalten"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which copy to keep"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué copia conservar"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelle copie conserver"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hangi kopya korunsun"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留哪一份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it Vervain skips protected folders such as Mail, Safari data and some caches, and tells you what it could not reach. Granting it is optional and you can change your mind in System Settings at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne ihn überspringt Vervain geschützte Ordner wie Mail, Safari-Daten und einige Caches und sagt Ihnen, was nicht erreichbar war. Die Freigabe ist optional, und Sie können es sich jederzeit in den Systemeinstellungen anders überlegen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without it Vervain skips protected folders such as Mail, Safari data and some caches, and tells you what it could not reach. Granting it is optional and you can change your mind in System Settings at any time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sin él, Vervain omite carpetas protegidas como Mail, los datos de Safari y algunas cachés, y te indica lo que no pudo alcanzar. Concederlo es opcional y puedes cambiar de opinión en Ajustes del Sistema en cualquier momento."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans lui, Vervain ignore les dossiers protégés comme Mail, les données de Safari et certains caches, et vous indique ce qu'il n'a pas pu atteindre. L'accorder est facultatif et vous pouvez changer d'avis à tout moment dans les Réglages Système."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu izin olmadan Vervain, Mail, Safari verileri ve bazı önbellekler gibi korumalı klasörleri atlar ve nelere ulaşamadığını size söyler. İzin vermek isteğe bağlıdır; fikrinizi Sistem Ayarları'ndan istediğiniz zaman değiştirebilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有此权限时，Vervain 会跳过“邮件”、Safari 数据和部分缓存等受保护的文件夹，并告诉您哪些无法访问。授予权限是可选的，您可以随时在系统设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
